erfall and swim in the river pools below.","highlights":["Around 500 steps each way","Swimming time in the pools","Bring water shoes"],"startDay":3,"startTime":"08:30","endDay":3,"endTime":"11:30"},{"kind":"tour","title":"Coffee and cacao farm visit","location":"Central Valley","imageUrl":"/imgs/packages/countryside.webp","description":"Follow the bean from plant to cup on a family farm, then taste the coffee and make your own chocolate.","highlights":["Tastings included","Meet the farming family"],"startDay":3,"startTime":"14:00","endDay":3,"endTime":"17:00"},{"kind":"transport","title":"La Fortuna to Manuel Antonio","imageUrl":"/imgs/packages/transfer-van.webp","description":"Private air-conditioned van with a bilingual driver. Stops along the way on request.","highlights":["Private transfer","Luggage help","Bottled water"],"startDay":4,"startTime":"11:00","endDay":4,"endTime":"16:00"},{"kind":"hotel","title":"Hillside ocean-view hotel","location":"Manuel Antonio","imageUrl":"/imgs/packages/cathedral-point.webp","description":"Rooms look over the forest to the Pacific, close to the national park. Breakfast included.","highlights":["Breakfast included","Ocean views","Pool"],"startDay":4,"startTime":"16:00","endDay":8,"endTime":"10:00"},{"kind":"tour","title":"Manuel Antonio National Park guided walk","location":"Manuel Antonio","imageUrl":"/imgs/packages/manuel-antonio-beach.webp","description":"An early start for the best wildlife: sloths, capuchins and toucans, ending on the park''s white-sand beaches.","highlights":["Park entrance included","Spotting scope with your guide","Swim time on the beach","Closed on Tuesdays"],"startDay":5,"startTime":"07:30","endDay":5,"endTime":"11:00"},{"kind":"tour","title":"Beach afternoon","location":"Manuel Antonio","imageUrl":"/imgs/packages/couple-beach.webp","description":"Free time on the sand. Your guide can recommend a quiet spot and a good place for a late lunch.","highlights":[],"startDay":5,"startTime":"14:00","endDay":5,"endTime":"17:00"},{"kind":"tour","title":"Sunset catamaran cruise","location":"Pacific coast","imageUrl":"/imgs/packages/guanacaste-catamaran.webp","description":"Sail along the coast with time to snorkel, then watch the sunset from the deck with dinner on board.","highlights":["Snorkel gear included","Open bar and dinner","Dolphins are often seen"],"startDay":6,"startTime":"13:00","endDay":6,"endTime":"17:30"},{"kind":"tour","title":"Beginner surf lesson","location":"Pacific coast","imageUrl":"/imgs/packages/surf.webp","description":"One-to-one coaching on a gentle beach break, with a board and rash guard provided.","highlights":["Board and rash guard included","No experience needed"],"startDay":7,"startTime":"09:00","endDay":7,"endTime":"11:00"},{"kind":"transport","title":"Manuel Antonio to San José airport","imageUrl":"/imgs/packages/transfer-van.webp","description":"Private air-conditioned van with a bilingual driver. Stops along the way on request.","highlights":["Private transfer","Luggage help","Bottled water"],"startDay":8,"startTime":"10:00","endDay":8,"endTime":"13:30"}]'::jsonb
),
